# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Kaitai struct definition for: Jpx FseEquities MarketByOrder Flex v1.1
#
# Protocol:
#   Organization: Japan Exchange Group
#   Protocol: Market By Order
#   Encoding: Flex
#   Version: 1.1
#   Date: 11/20/2024
#   Specification: TSEarrowhead_FLEX_MarketbyOrderSpecifications_ver.1.1.pdf
#
